            "m_dialog": "Barghest himself is in there. He is smarter than he lets on, likes to play the fool so others underestimate him.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
